# VUE + INERTIA PATTERNS

## Component Structure

- All page components in `resources/js/Pages/`
- Reusable components in `resources/js/Components/`
- UseCompositionAPI with ` < s c ri p t setup>`

## Inertia Rout ing

```php
/Backend (routes/web.php)
Route:get('/users', f u n c t i o n () {
r e t u r n Inertia::render('Users/Index',
[ 'users' => User::all()
]);
});
```

```vue
<!-- Frontend (resources/js/Pages/Users/Index.vue) -->
<template>
    <div>
        <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
        <div v-for="user in users" :key="user.id">
            {{ user.name }}
        </div>
    </div>
</template>
<script setup>
import { ref } from "vue";
const props = defineProps({ users: Array });
const title = ref("Users List");
</script>
```

## Navigation

```vue
<!-- Use Link component -->
<Link href="/dashboard">Dashboard</Link>
<!-- NOT regular anchor -->
<a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
❌
```

## Forms

```vue
<script setup>
import { useForm } from "@inertiajs/vue3";
const form = useForm({ name: "", email: "" });
const submit = () => {
    form.post("/users");
};
</script>
<template>
    <form @submit.prevent="submit">
        <input v-model="form.name" />
        <input v-model="form.email" />
        <button type="submit">Submit</button>
    </form>
</template>
```

##Access Shared Data

